wsl.exe -d Ubuntu-24.04 -e bash -c 'export PATH="$HOME/.local/bin:$PATH"; cd /mnt/c/Users/benya/projects/quakeworld/route-lab && uv sync && uv run python -m unittest discover -s tests'
```

WSL invocation traps (burned 2026-07-16/17): never `wsl -- bash -lc
"<script>"` with inline `$()`/`$var` — the launcher double-expands before
bash sees it; pass long scripts as FILES (or stdin as bytes; CRLF-mangling
otherwise). NAT-mode WSL (other machines) drops localhost UDP — probe the
WSL NAT IP instead. "Transient" build failures rarely are — check the
process list before retrying.

