0036: **Naming rule (owner 2026-07-20):** all planfile rows, orders, reports
0037: and GH comments refer to seats by FUNCTION (Orchestrator, dm3-operator,
0038: navmesh-worker, bot-code, Auditor) — never by model/instance name.
0039: Model names may appear only when the model choice itself is the topic.
0040: Seats are functions: any LLM must be able to take a seat from repo
0041: documentation alone (hot-swap goal). The Orchestrator seat's operational
0042: handbook is `docs/orchestration-runbook.md`.
0043: 
0044: The lab runs as a multi-agent team. **Seats are functions, not models** —
0045: any capable agent can fill any seat (current occupant + herdr pane noted
0046: only so you can find each other). Everything here is plain CLIs + files.
